 y ✨\, Sobble ✨\nWild Encounters: Bulbasaur ✨\, Charmander ✨\, Squirtle ✨\
 , Caterpie ✨\, Pikachu ✨\, Growlithe ✨\, Abra ✨\, Machop ✨\, Gastly ✨\, K
 rabby ✨\, Hitmonlee ✨\, Hitmonchan ✨\, Rhyhorn ✨\, Chansey ✨\, Electabuzz
  ✨\, Magmar ✨\, Magikarp ✨\, Eevee ✨\, Omanyte ✨\, Kabuto ✨\, Hoothoot ✨\
 , Shuckle ✨\, Sneasel ✨\, Hitmontop ✨\, Ralts ✨\, Sableye ✨\, Wailmer ✨\,
  Trapinch ✨\, Feebas ✨\, Spheal ✨\, Beldum ✨\, Combee ✨\, Pidove ✨\, Rogg
 enrola ✨\, Woobat ✨\, Drilbur ✨\, Cottonee ✨\, Darumaka ✨\, Trubbish ✨\, 
