DESCRIPTION:Event\nCelebrate Twilight Wishes with costumed Espeon and Umb
 reon\, increased Shiny chances for Staryu and Elgyem\, and event GO Pass 
 rewards and bonuses!\nFeatured Pokémon: Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbr
 eon wearing a moon scarf\, Rockruff\nSpawns: Clefairy\, Staryu\, Elgyem\,
  Rockruff\nOne-Star Raids: Pikachu wearing a sun crown\, Pikachu wearing 
 a moon crown\nThree-Star Raids: Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbreon wear
 ing a moon scarf\nMega Raids: Mega Beedrill\, Mega Houndoom\, Mega Sabley
 e\, Mega Manectric\nNovember 24 at 10:00 a.m. to November 26 at 10:00 a.m
 . local time: Applin\, Maschiff\nNovember 26 at 10:00 a.m. to November 30
  at 8:00 p.m. local time: Gengar wearing a Spooky Festival costume\, Bram
 blin\nBonuses: Increased chance to encounter Shiny Staryu and Shiny Elgye
 m\nDetails: https://leekduck.com/events/twilight-wishes-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/twilight-wishes-2026/
